Subject: [PATCH] webui: interpret reused POST codes within each boot cycle

Use the 2026-10-12 AMI Aptio V reference update. Intel RC alternatives are
explicitly unconfirmed for GNR-D. Decode pre-memory overlaps in receive order,
retain both interpretations without reliable context, and use live context
from the boot-progress service. Keep unmatched values visible.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD firmware reference]

